---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact | cppMax" description="Email cppMax support, report an app problem, or contact the developer.">
  <header class="contact-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <h1>Contact.</h1>
      <p>Choose the address that matches what you need.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="contact-section">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <article>
        <span class="contact-number">01</span>
        <h2>Support</h2>
        <p>Get help with cppMax, beta access, or something that is not working as expected.</p>
        <a href="mailto:support@cppmax.com">support@cppmax.com</a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span class="contact-number">02</span>
        <h2>App feedback and bug reports</h2>
        <p>The in-app feedback tool is easier because it can include the relevant app and build details. If cppMax or its feedback tool does not work, send the report manually.</p>
        <a href="mailto:feedback@cppmax.com">feedback@cppmax.com</a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span class="contact-number">03</span>
        <h2>Contact me</h2>
        <p>Use this address for messages that do not belong in support or app feedback.</p>
        <a href="mailto:contact@cppmax.com">contact@cppmax.com</a>
      </article>

      <article class="address-card">
        <span class="contact-number">04</span>
        <h2>Address</h2>
        <p>If you are still in the stone ages and want to send physical mail for some reason.</p>
        <span class="blank-address" aria-label="Address not provided"></span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-hero { padding: clamp(82px, 11vw, 142px) 0 clamp(70px, 9vw, 112px); text-align: center; background: #f8fbff; }
  .contact-hero h1 { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto 24px; color: #08090b; font-size: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7.6rem); line-height: .92; }
  .contact-hero p { margin: 0 auto; color: #53565a; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem); }
  .contact-section { padding: 88px 24px 124px; color: #f5f5f7; background: #242526; }
  .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: min(1100px, 100%); margin-inline: auto; }
  .contact-grid article { display: flex; min-height: 330px; flex-direction: column; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #454649; border-radius: 22px; background: #2d2e30; }
  .contact-number { margin-bottom: 64px; color: #78b8ff; font: 700 .72rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .contact-grid h2 { margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 3rem); }
  .contact-grid p { max-width: 520px; color: #b7b8bc; }
  .contact-grid a { margin-top: auto; color: #78b8ff; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem); font-weight: 700; text-underline-offset: 5px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .address-card { min-height: 240px !important; }
  .blank-address { display: block; min-height: 48px; margin-top: auto; border-bottom: 1px solid #5b5d61; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
